<section class="container section"><p class="eyebrow">CONECTEMOS IDEAS</p><div class="contact-grid"><div><h1>Todo lo bueno<br>empieza con<br><em>una charla.</em></h1><p class="large-text"><?= e(setting('about')) ?></p><a href="<?= setting('whatsapp')?e(whatsapp()):'#datos-contacto' ?>" class="btn social-link"><?php if(setting('whatsapp')): $socialNetwork='whatsapp'; require ROOT.'/views/social-icon.php'; endif ?><?= setting('whatsapp')?'Escribinos por WhatsApp ↗':'Nuestros datos ↓' ?></a></div><div class="contact-card" id="datos-contacto"><span class="little-star"><span class="brand-symbol" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><h2>Hablemos de tu idea.</h2><p>Contanos qué tenés en mente, para cuándo lo necesitás y cuántas piezas imaginás.</p><?php if(setting('contact_email')): ?><div><small>CORREO</small><a href="mailto:<?= e(setting('contact_email')) ?>"><?= e(setting('contact_email')) ?> ↗</a></div><?php endif ?><?php if(setting('contact_address')): ?><div><small>ENCONTRANOS</small><p class="preserve"><?= e(setting('contact_address')) ?></p></div><?php endif ?><?php if(setting('hours')): ?><div><small>HORARIOS</small><p class="preserve"><?= e(setting('hours')) ?></p></div><?php endif ?><div><small>RETIRO EN EL TALLER</small><p><?= e(setting('pickup')) ?></p></div><div class="social-links"><?php foreach(['instagram'=>'Instagram','facebook'=>'Facebook'] as $key=>$label): if(setting($key)): ?><a href="<?= e(setting($key)) ?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="social-link"><?php $socialNetwork=$key; require ROOT.'/views/social-icon.php'; ?><?= $label ?> ↗</a><?php endif; endforeach ?></div><?php if(!setting('contact_email') && !setting('whatsapp')): ?><p class="microcopy">Pronto publicaremos nuestros canales de contacto.</p><?php endif ?></div></div></section>
